License: LICENSE.SF3D in this directory.

Local integration changes:
- SF3D neural geometry and material inference use the complete upstream checkpoint.
- Encoders retain float32 weights and move between CPU and GPU per component.
- Attention and density queries are chunked to reduce peak memory; the model
  does not require unsupported BF16 operations on the NVIDIA Pascal GPU.
- xatlas packs UVs; ModernGL rasterizes barycentric texture coordinates instead
  of compiling the upstream CUDA texture baker and UV extension on Windows.
- Image encoders initialize from configuration; their learned parameters are
  streamed from the complete SF3D checkpoint with strict key/shape validation,
  including aliases of shared parameters, without a duplicate state dictionary.
- The HTTP job adapter stores GLBs privately and supplies progress and retry state.
